{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "017kir_401_2_4_017_01_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:362701b00d84d07fe467382b6fa073872ffcc2b7508cce8852f30e1a2096093b",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:017kir_401_2_4_017_01_09_a:2_4_017_01_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86a7dac6a3d326b96c23ab46a42f1e20aa78b1c06edab856320c418b55024d55",
      "text": "喂喂，制作人君！\n跨年倒计时歌唱节目，辛苦了喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:017kir_401_2_4_017_01_09_a:2_4_017_01_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5dba7f60b454ac16ea9c9a6eb1f147095a972acd6b985713b9e465d3bf1edc0c",
      "text": "那个歌唱节目，\n从头到尾都好有趣喵～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:017kir_401_2_4_017_01_09_a:2_4_017_01_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da5853a22307a2a4535e93cc393c33b009e7b56c8faea010310042049500cb4d",
      "text": "工作人员君们团团忙乱地转来转去，\n舞台的景象也不断变化，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:017kir_401_2_4_017_01_09_a:2_4_017_01_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc4ee21f013b940b748d3adec113ab532fc0c86deea15f44dda62ef6784c59dd",
      "text": "光是看着就觉得好开心喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:017kir_401_2_4_017_01_09_a:2_4_017_01_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d0476a6004b7996f35a3e2ee9e1cc7586e63a68299afeb232b15d68bcfda74e",
      "text": "直播的那种紧张感也相当刺激喵。\n虽然蝶蝶小姐已经习惯了喵，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:017kir_401_2_4_017_01_09_a:2_4_017_01_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60e2b96f34e37d198b8e788145cc9aaf5c1c447ea64a0e680d3e9dc491729620",
      "text": "但九郎君因为紧张身体都僵硬了，\n所以吾辈在进广告的时候找他搭话了喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:017kir_401_2_4_017_01_09_a:2_4_017_01_09_a:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84caee17751ee26c1c4db88917ab03ed265fbdb11759a8966b80bb5463250e54",
      "text": "结果，居然！那个镜头好像被拍进去了，\n听说在社交平台上成了热门话题喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:017kir_401_2_4_017_01_09_a:2_4_017_01_09_a:cmd-000020:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5addfbf2f5470b6d73a7dc79988a662f94e7d379fb5bb30a90fb32892a184c05",
      "text": "我稍后去确认一下",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:017kir_401_2_4_017_01_09_a:2_4_017_01_09_a:cmd-000021:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f0a371b67444d24342434dd6f3c610f9459020735022e2129f5fcba1e447000",
      "text": "很期待查看呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:017kir_401_2_4_017_01_09_a:2_4_017_01_09_a:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a0a6373fe31792360898b73948e08f1894f54e138e774012a8464e59cae813c",
      "text": "吾辈也是喵！吾辈打算回家之后，\n就去看录下来的节目喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:017kir_401_2_4_017_01_09_a:2_4_017_01_09_a:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d44febac8506174cd2d808248aed8a6958ef28fb87cf6b3c0eb151b65c1cb7a0",
      "text": "说不定还有其他地方也被镜头拍到了喵！\n要是发现了一定要告诉吾辈喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
